      en: ["Elevation: 411 meters above sea level", "Population: approximately 6,700 inhabitants", "Year of IGP certification for mushrooms: 1993", "Awarded the Gold Medal for Military Valor after WWII", "Main church: 15th-century San Domenico", "Distance from Parma: approximately 65 kilometers"],
